<title>UK: German inland gas oil gains, volume flat.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil gains, volume flat.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.5477)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     38.70/39.00     25.00/25.19     38.30/38.60</p>
<p> BREMEN		38.70/39.00     25.00/25.19     38.30/38.60</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    38.30/38.70     24.74/25.00     38.00/38.30</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   39.00/39.30     25.19/25.39     38.60/39.00</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   39.10/39.50     25.26/25.52     38.80/39.10</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  40.00/40.30     25.84/26.03     39.70/40.00</p>
<p>German inland gas oil prices rose on Tuesday on the back of a rally in futures. Demand remained listless and volume was modest. -- London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
